<title>DUBAI: Saudi Aramco lifts bunker fuel oil prices.</title>
<headline>Saudi Aramco lifts bunker fuel oil prices.</headline>
<dateline>DUBAI 1996-10-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Saudi Aramco has increased A-960 bunker fuel lifted from the Gulf by $3 a tonne to $127 ($19.49 barrel) and by $4 a tonne to $128 ($19.65) from Red Sea ports.</p>
<p>A-888 bunker diesel is $3 a tonne higher from all ports at $220 a tonne. Prices are effective October 10, Aramco said.</p>
<p>-- Dubai Newsroom, +971 4 6071255</p>
</text>
